WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:08.299
"Mo can't be missing," Cora said.

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.962
Rita bit her lip.

3
00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:14.814
"We were supposed to meet an hour ago.

4
00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:20.741
But he never showed up."

5
00:00:20.742 --> 00:00:24.652
"Did you look in Seaweed Forest?" Sasha asked.

6
00:00:24.653 --> 00:00:28.626
"Not there," Rita said.

7
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:33.916
"What about Sandy Bottom?" the plankton asked.

8
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:37.074
"Nope," Rita said.

9
00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:41.231
"Maybe Mo forgot to meet you," Cora said.

10
00:00:41.232 --> 00:00:44.958
"He's probably collecting sea glass."

11
00:00:44.959 --> 00:00:48.736
Rita shrugged. "Maybe.

12
00:00:48.737 --> 00:00:53.088
But I think we should look for him."

13
00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:57.177
Cora nodded. "I'll go to the compass."

14
00:00:57.178 --> 00:01:00.349
"I'll come with you," Rita said.

15
00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:09.595
"I can help you search."

16
00:01:09.596 --> 00:01:15.815
In the cave Cora shot her ink.

17
00:01:15.816 --> 00:01:18.791
Cora gulped.

18
00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:23.338
The shell showed a picture of giant boulders!

19
00:01:23.339 --> 00:01:27.221
"What is that place?" Rita asked.

20
00:01:27.222 --> 00:01:31.123
"Boulder Valley," Cora said.

21
00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.465
"Dangerous fish live there!"

22
00:01:34.466 --> 00:01:38.715
"What do you mean?" Rita asked.

23
00:01:38.716 --> 00:01:43.130
"Some of them eat small fish," Cora said.

24
00:01:43.131 --> 00:01:46.655
"They like to eat small octopuses too!"

25
00:01:46.656 --> 00:01:51.860
Rita looked scared. "Should we just go back?

26
00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:56.833
Mo will probably show up soon."

27
00:01:56.834 --> 00:01:58.265
Whoosh!

28
00:01:58.266 --> 00:02:03.273
The arrow shot out of the compass.

29
00:02:03.274 --> 00:02:06.617
"Come on, Rita," Cora said.

30
00:02:06.618 --> 00:02:14.268
"We're going to Boulder Valley!"

